            "review_text": "Pioneer09020973634\n1 contribution\n0\nExperience traditional pho at Pho Mai\nMay 2024 • Solo\nThe space is clean, the kitchen counter is connected to the seating so you can observe how the kitchen prepares food. Peace of mind for diners. The food is quite good. Price is also ok.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 28, 2024\nPhở Mai\nDạ, Phở Mai xin cảm ơn Quý khách hàng đã ghé trải nghiệm quán và đưa ra những đánh giá giúp cải thiện dịch vụ của quán. Hẹn gặp lại Quý khách trong thời gian sắp tới ạ🍜\nRead more\nWritten May 28, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
